<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Powdertech Co rated &quot;2&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Powdertech Co rated &quot;2&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd has assigned a &quot;2&quot; rating to Powdertech Co Ltd, Nikko Securities brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute gives a &quot;2&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the Nikkei average over the next six months.</p>
<p>Powdertech produces carrier powder for electronic copying machines.</p>
</text>
